{"overview":"سیدارت، یک آتئیست و شکاک، به سفری مرموز در اطراف معبد باستانی واراهی در ماهندراگیری کشیده می‌شود؛ او در حالی که رازهای مرتبط با این مکان مقدس را کشف می‌کند، مجبور می‌شود با نیروهایی فراتر از درک خود روبرو شود و باورهایش را به چالش کشیده، درکش از ایمان، سرنوشت و ماوراءالطبیعه را دگرگون می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Siddharth, an atheist and skeptic, is drawn into a mysterious journey surrounding the ancient Varahi temple at Mahendragiri. As he uncovers secrets connected to the sacred site, he is forced to confront forces beyond his understanding, challenging his beliefs and changing his perception of faith, destiny, and the supernatural.","tagline_en":"","runtime":154,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Santosh Jagarlapudi"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IN"],"cast":[{"name":"Sumanth","role":"Siddharth","photo":"/1KbLdhw6S9A3EBM1dUyGfSOpzXO.jpg"},{"name":"Meenakshi Goswami","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"آیشواریا راجش","role":"","photo":"/yM13Up2NnSPHZ03eepxPjWMjsY9.jpg","en":"Aishwarya Rajesh"},{"name":"Malavika Nair","role":"","photo":"/cc4SDmyEmQPq2L8LHNm3sGHIkDr.jpg","en":"Malvika Nair"},{"name":"Manju Bhargavi","role":"","photo":"/2hWAF3kJHKhcXGdpcfDhihLl3ql.jpg"},{"name":"బ్రహ్మానందం","role":"","photo":"/zh6nWEIy3l1dsZA9EDuDezq867b.jpg","en":"Brahmanandam"},{"name":"రాజీవ్ కనకాల","role":"","photo":"/29Czs1esSU744TOe3ddDzCuCa0g.jpg","en":"Rajeev Kanakala"},{"name":"Rajsekhar Aningi","role":"","photo":"/94HucKw853cUKaZOEpTheZCq54M.jpg"},{"name":"علی","role":"","photo":"/xAlsMcBNmkBS2KT6jqMUjGirvLq.jpg","en":"Ali"},{"name":"Vennela Kishore","role":"","photo":"/8a0mcxMPjD4KR15gyE5QmbDeTub.jpg"},{"name":"Vamsee Chaganti","role":"","photo":"/f7RkBxBmE6VtzqtZakj4urJxes7.jpg"},{"name":"Kamal Kamaraju","role":"","photo":"/dzRe0pHRcBHTKJCGcMFjPJ0K8Fp.jpg"}],"trailer":"LaT_k0FSg0c","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1049064/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLp